li><p>All references in the article text are cited in the reference list, a=
nd vice versa.</p></li><li><p>Permission has been obtained for the use of a=
ny copyrighted material from other sources, including the Web.</p></li><li>=
<p>For open access articles, all authors understand that they are responsib=
