itor's decision and requests for revision, is sent by email.</p><p>Please f=
ollow this link to <a href=3D"https://submit.elsevier.com/FUFO">submit your=
 paper</a>.</p></div></div></div><div id=3D"after-receiving-a-final-decisio=
n"><h3>After receiving a final decision</h3><div id=3D"after-receiving-a-fi=
nal-decision-article-transfer-service"><h4>Article Transfer Service</h4><di=
v><p>If your manuscript is more suitable for an alternative journal publish=
