a href=3D"https://www.elsevier.com/about/accessibility">page about improvin=
g accessibility</a>.</p><p>The purpose of the proof is to check the typeset=
ting, editing, completeness and correctness of your article text, tables an=
d figures. Significant changes to your article at the proofing stage will o=
nly be considered with approval of the journal editor.</p></div></div><div =
id=3D"after-receiving-a-final-decision-sharing-your-published-article"><h4>=
